'' An operator's shape: 17 errors on fbc-modern 1.20 and 1.10.1 alike, on exactly these lines
'' (2026-09-19) -- fbc's 1 for a parameter count an operator does not take, 153 for a
'' member '+' and '->', 152 for a global '@', 'new' and 'for', 157 for 'andalso' and
'' 'orelse' at the end. The member shapes from line 16 and the global ones from line 32
'' are accepted by both.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/operator-shape.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 17
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(7,13): error TKO0789: operator '+=' takes 1 parameter(s) here
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(8,13): error TKO0789: operator 'let' takes 1 parameter(s) here
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(9,13): error TKO0789: operator 'cast' takes 0 parameter(s) here
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(10,13): error TKO0789: operator '[]' takes 1 parameter(s) here
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(11,13): error TKO0789: operator 'for' takes 0 or 1 parameter(s) here
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(12,13): error TKO0789: operator 'next' takes 1 or 2 parameter(s) here
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(13,13): error TKO0789: operator 'new' takes 1 parameter(s) here
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(14,13): error TKO0790: operator '+' cannot be a member of a type
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(15,13): error TKO0790: operator '->' cannot be a member of a type
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(26,9): error TKO0789: operator '=' takes 2 parameter(s) here
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(27,9): error TKO0789: operator 'not' takes 1 parameter(s) here
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(28,9): error TKO0789: operator '-' takes 1 or 2 parameter(s) here
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(29,9): error TKO0697: operator '@' must be a member of a type
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(30,9): error TKO0697: operator 'new' must be a member of a type
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(31,9): error TKO0697: operator 'for' must be a member of a type
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(40,9): error TKO0792: 'andalso' cannot be overloaded
'' EXPECT-OUT: operator-shape.bas(41,9): error TKO0792: 'orelse' cannot be overloaded
